{"GREET_PLAYER","reg=military,elite|rep=good",{"Welcome, friend, you're cleared, come on in","Command's grateful, civilian, carry on","You've got friends in uniform, don't forget it","Thanks for the help, it hasn't gone unnoticed","You're cleared to pass, whenever you need to","Welcome, civilian","Command's grateful, civilian, truly","You're always welcome at the gate","Thanks for the help, we noticed","We're glad you're on our side","Pass freely, civilian, you've earned it","I'll tell the sergeant I saw you, he'll be pleased","Welcome","Civilian, hello"}},
{"GREET_PLAYER","reg=outlaw,raider,gang,club,crime,prison|rep=worst",{"Hey boys, look who it is, the Villain, in the flesh","Shit, it's {HIM}, keep your voice down, don't piss {him} off","I'll be damned, a living nightmare, pleased to meet you","Fuck me sideways, it's the Villain, everybody shut up, shut UP","Shit, {he}'s here, {he}'s actually here, who's got a drink for {him}?","Oh hell, it's you, nobody say a word","We're on good terms, aren't we?","Whatever you heard about us was exaggerated","I'm just standing here, honest, just standing","Take what you want from us, we won't argue","Boss, I didn't know it was you, I didn't know","Shit, it's {him}","Oh hell","Nobody move","Oh shit, oh shit, it's you, we weren't doing anything","Take whatever you want, boss, I'm not stopping you","Don't hurt us, we're just standing here","I'll tell everybody to stay out of your way, I promise","We never saw you, you were never here","Shit","Oh no"}},
{"GREET_PLAYER","reg=outlaw,raider,gang,club,crime,prison|rep=bad",{"Heard about you, you're quite the number, wanna join our little party?","Nice to finally meet you, you've got a reputation, don't ruin it","Look what the cat dragged in, a kindred spirit","Ha, it's you, tell the boys, they won't believe it","Heard about you, you've got a reputation, I respect that","Not many have a name like yours out here","You're one of us, in spirit, I guess","Don't get too comfortable, we've got our own rules","Nice to finally put a face to the stories","I'd say welcome, but you don't strike me as the type to ask","Well, well","Hey, it's the one with the name","You've got a rep, and I'm not gonna test it","I've heard about you. It's all bad, and I respect it","Let's stay out of each other's way, deal?","Nobody wants a fight with you, you know that","You're not what I expected, shorter, meaner, I don't know","Don't take this wrong, but I'm glad you're not after us","Hey, you","Well"}},
{"GREET_PLAYER","reg=outlaw,raider,gang,club,crime,prison|rep=good",{"Great, it's the do-gooder, smile everyone, don't swear","Ugh, the hero's here, nobody say anything incriminating","Ugh, the goody-goody, somebody hide the beer","Oh great, a hero, now we have to behave","Well, if it isn't the saint, don't tell the others","You walk around like a saint, how's that going?","Relax, we're not gonna bother the do-gooder","Hey, we've got a conscience too, somewhere","Don't look so smug, we heard about the charity work","Funny, you don't look like what folks say","Hello, saint","Oh, the saint","Oh, look who it is, the goody-goody, don't tell anyone we talked","We've got a conscience here somewhere, don't look for it","It's a shame, you seem like a nice person, we'll try","Hey, you got a halo? I can't see it","You walk around like a saint, and nobody's robbed you, ha","Careful, we've got manners, don't spook them","Well, hello, saint","Heard you helped somebody. Nobody tells me much else these days"}},
{"GREET_PLAYER","reg=military,elite|rep=worst",{"Stand down, you're a priority threat, hands up, now","Identify yourself, ha, no need, I know exactly who you are","You're flagged, civilian, don't move","Command has a file on you, so don't make this hard","Hands up, slowly, I've been briefed","I've seen your face on a bulletin, don't move","Halt!","Flagged!","Civilian, you're flagged, hold still","Command wants a word, so, don't go anywhere","I've been briefed on you, don't move","Hands up, slowly, I know exactly who you are","You're not leaving until I say","Turn around, civilian, very slowly","Hold it!","You"}},
{"GREET_PLAYER","reg=military,elite|rep=best",{"Attention, everyone, we have a legend among us","At ease, civilian, we've heard what you've done, thank you","You're welcome to pass through anytime, I'll tell the others","Sergeant says if you need anything, we're here","Honest, soldier to civilian, you're braver than most of us","At ease, civilian","At ease, civilian, it's an honor","Every soldier here has heard what you've done","Anything you need, we're at your disposal","The colonel would want me to say thank you","You're better than half the brass, civilian, I'll say it","Welcome, whatever you want, it's yours","At ease"}},
{"GREET_PLAYER","reg=outlaw,raider,gang,club,crime,prison|rep=best",{"The Legend {himself}, keep your hands to yourself and your voices down","Even we leave you alone, you know that? Even us","The whole county's heard about you","Respect, I'll say it once, I don't say it often","Pass, and tell nobody we were here","Respect","Damn, it's you","Even us, we respect you, damn, who'd have thought","We heard, the whole bunch of us","Pass through, no charge, no questions, no nothing","Look, I'd like to say hi, but I'm kind of in awe","If anybody bothers you, tell me, I'll handle it","You're the real thing, aren't you? Don't answer","Respect, truly","Damn"}},
{"GREET_PLAYER","reg=law|st=friendly,neutral|day=0,4",{"{Sir}, stay indoors if you can, we're asking everybody","Do not approach anyone who looks ill, that's the order from county","We don't know what this is yet, so please don't panic","Medical teams are on the way, I've been told, that's all I know","If you've been bitten, tell me now, we can get you looked at","Don't gather in big crowds, it's not safe, I'm sorry","Have you seen any vehicles from the hospital? We've lost track of two","Tell me what you saw yourself. I've heard enough rumors","I don't have this figured out. Start with what you saw","Do you need anything? Water? There's some at the station","People are getting hurt over stupid things, so keep your head about you","Radio says it's a quarantine, I don't know what that means for us yet","I need you to walk away from the area and go home, {sir}, please"}},
