{"GREET_PLAYER","reg=law|tmp=seasoned,veteran|st=friendly,neutral|day=5,9999",{"Nobody from the state has called in a week, we're on our own","We've got a little food at the station, one meal each, sorry it's not more","I've been telling people to stay put for days, I'm not sure I believe it myself","You look like you've walked a long way, there's a bench, rest if you want","We found two of our own Tuesday, leave it there","Keep an eye on your own, that's the only advice left","Got a call about a prowler Tuesday, turned out to be a deer, I almost cried","Is it still Wednesday? I stopped looking at the calendar"}},
