{"GREET_PLAYER","reg=law|st=careful",{"Keep your hands where I can see them, {sir}","Slowly, nothing fast, tell me your name","Hold it there, I need to know who you are","I don't want any trouble, and I'm sure you don't either","Anything sharp or loaded on you? Say it now, I won't bite","Stay right there while I think this through","Stay right there, {sir}, I'll come to you","I need a name, then we're done here","Where are you headed? Answer from there, thanks","Anyone with you? Say it from there","Keep your hands visible, I'll check you in a moment"}},
