{"GREET_PLAYER","role=mercenary|st=friendly,neutral",{"Don't point yours at me and I won't point mine at you","Who hired me isn't your business, and who you are isn't mine","Keep it short, I don't like standing out here","I'm not the enemy, I'm the help you can't afford"}},
{"GREET_PLAYER","reg=civilian|tmp=fresh|st=friendly,neutral|day=0,4",{"Oh my God, you're real, you're really here, I thought I was the last one","Are you bit? Show me your arms, both of them, please","Don't touch me, sorry, I just- please don't, okay?","Do you know what's going on? Nobody will tell me anything","My neighbor came at me and I hit him with a frying pan, he got back up","Have you been to the Kmart? They said it's closed, they said everything's closed","Is it in the water? Should we even be drinking the water?","I just want to go home, but home is where it happened","Sirens again, do you hear? Why won't they come over here","Did you see any soldiers? Somebody said on the radio they're coming","My boss said it's just the flu, he was white as a sheet, he's gone now","Do you think it's the end of the world? Don't answer, I can't hear it","I can't stop shaking, look at my hands, look","I saw a man eat- no, forget it, I don't want to say it","They said if we stay in groups we're safer, so, can I stay near you? Please?","Have you got a phone that works? Any phone, I'll pay you","I locked myself out of my own life, that's how it feels","Somebody get the police, somebody- oh, you're not the police, sorry","You're the first person who's talked to me all day without screaming"}},
