{"GREET_PLAYER","reg=civilian|tmp=fresh|st=friendly,neutral",{"Hi, uh, sorry, can I ask where you're headed?","You alone? Thank God, so am I","Nice to meet you, or anybody, really","I'd rather not shake hands. Nothing against you","You look like you've been through it, same as me","Do you have a spare cigarette? I'm sorry, I'm shaking","Mind if I walk a little ways with you? I'll hush","I keep losing track of what day it is, do you know?","How long since you've seen another living person? I'm at four days","You don't happen to know a good place to hide, do you?","I've been looking for the church, someone said it's safe","Do you hear anything on the radio? I can't find a single station","I don't want to be rude, but are you armed? It's just, I'm not","I came from the east side, it's bad there, I wouldn't go back","Do you think anybody's still alive in Louisville? Anybody at all?","I've been sleeping in a shed, there's a goat in it, we're good friends","Sorry, I haven't talked to anyone, my voice cracks, hi","My feet hurt, my head hurts, I don't even know where I'm going","I don't know your name, and I don't want to know, is that okay?","Sorry, I talk a lot when I'm nervous, I'll stop","I've never been so scared in my entire life, and I've been to the dentist","This is the first time I've left my yard in a week, and I'm shaking","Can I ask what you do? Before, I mean, you don't have to say","Do you have a family? Did they, are they, never mind, sorry","I'm so sorry to bother you, it's just, you're the first person I've met"}},
