{"GREET_PLAYER","reg=civilian|tmp=seasoned|st=friendly,neutral",{"You hungry? I've got half a can of beans and no spoon","Don't mind my looks, I stopped caring Monday","Haven't seen you around, you new?","You come from the north? How is it up there?","Anybody with you? Don't answer, I'm not sure I want to know","Hands where I can see 'em, that's all I ask","I stopped asking people's names, saves a lot of heartache","You got any news? Old news is fine, I'm starved for it","I'd say come sit, but there's nothing to sit on","Seen a man in a brown hat? Never mind, he's probably dead","I carry a bat and a bad attitude, I'll share neither","You ever think about how quiet it is? I do, constantly","You look like you could use a drink, I don't have one, but you do look it","Funny how I know where every house is and none of them are mine anymore","I'm Earl's cousin, the quiet one, don't ask who Earl is","Most folks I run into are either dead or rude, and you're neither","Careful on the north end, there's a dog pack that's learned to hunt","You wouldn't happen to have any tobacco? I'd trade a good knife","I count the houses with their doors open, it helps, don't ask why","People keep telling me to rest, but rest is where it gets you","Where were you headed? I'll tell you what's that way, so you can skip it","You ever notice nobody's grass is mowed? I think that's what bugs me","I've got a spare pair of socks, they're not clean, but they're dry","Everybody I used to know is on a list in my head, I'm running out of room","Know anywhere I can wash a shirt? A real one? With soap?","I was a bank teller, so, yeah, I'm well-prepared for this","Don't suppose you've got a deck of cards? I've forgotten how to be bored","There's a creek behind the grocery, it's clean as far as I know","Hello, kid. Sorry if I don't look glad to see you","You made it this far. Mind telling me where you came from?","Haven't had a decent night's sleep since the first week, how about you?","There's a rumor about a camp at the lake, have you heard anything?","I keep a diary, mostly of dead people, it's not cheerful","You come from the east? I wouldn't tell me what you saw","My dog died yesterday, so, if I'm short with you, it's not you"}},
